[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2741951236","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104418#issuecomment-2741951236","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104418","id":2741951236,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jbtsE","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T00:31:30Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T00:32:05Z","body":"You're parenting to a Panel which is not a Container, hence its min size is not affected by its children's min sizes. Use PanelContainers instead of Panels and it should work as you want (as PanelContainer will respect its children's min sizes).\n\nI don't see a bug in here.\n\nHere's a much simpler example:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/874dc846-85b5-4f8a-acee-c295353f7e5b)\n\nNote how:\n- Control is getting shrinked to zero width by the HSplitContainer (nothing prevents that!),\n- Control's child full-rect ColorRect has min size exceeding its parent size, hence it ends up overflowing left/right.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2741951236/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744555435","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104418#issuecomment-2744555435","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104418","id":2744555435,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jlper","user":{"login":"lycano","id":719121,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTEyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/719121?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lycano","html_url":"https://github.com/lycano","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lycano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lycano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lycano/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lycano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lycano/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lycano/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lycano/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lycano/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lycano/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T22:05:18Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T22:05:18Z","body":"@kleonc Thank you! By changing Panel to PanelContainer it works now. I simply used the wrong type. I also changed the title to reflect it is indeed not a bug but simply a user error.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744555435/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]